From: Nick Farrell <nick.farrell@aiven.io>
Date: Fri, 29 May 2026 22:10:22 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(fakes): add UpCloud fake API server

Implements a fake UpCloud API server for /1.3/account/tokens and
/1.3/account endpoints with HTTP Basic auth validation, token CRUD,
and error injection support.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
